<div class="hero-text">
<p class="hero-heading"><strong>Discover Dakota College</strong></p>

<p class="hero-sub">Nestled at the base of the Turtle Mountains, DCB is a two year college that empowers students to grow their future through hands‑on learning, supportive community, and pathways that lead to real world success.</p>

<p><a href="/about"><button class="dcb3-button dcb3-button1">Click here to learn more</button></a></p>
