                <div class="grid-inner">

                                                                    <div class="entry-image">    
                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/dcb-alumni-association-supports-students-through-annual-fundraising-efforts">
                                <img src="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/application/files/cache/thumbnails/hockey-50th-daa8b7c3095b6cb90ede5697e56adfc7.png" alt="DCB Alumni Association Supports Students through Annual Fundraising Efforts">
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    
                                            <div class="entry-title">
                                                            <h2>
                                                                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/dcb-alumni-association-supports-students-through-annual-fundraising-efforts"
                                           target="">DCB Alumni Association Supports Students through Annual Fundraising Efforts</a>
                                                                        </h2>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-meta"><ul><li>
                                    <i class="icon-calendar3"></i>
                                    Nov 13, 2026, 8:55 AM                                </li></ul></div>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-content">
                                    Dakota College at Bottineau Alumni Association became a standing committee of the Dakota College at Bottineau Foundation in 1996. Since then, the Alumni Association has remained committed to supporting students through scholarship fundraising efforts.                                </div>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                                    </div>
                </div>

            
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
                <div class="grid-inner">

                                                                    <div class="entry-image">    
                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/leaderjacks-sponsoring-food-drive">
                                <img src="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/application/files/cache/thumbnails/fans2-6c9ab606a1962d9f6d4854123e35f549.png" alt="Leaderjacks Sponsoring a Food Drive">
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    
                                            <div class="entry-title">
                                                            <h2>
                                                                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/leaderjacks-sponsoring-food-drive"
                                           target="">Leaderjacks Sponsoring a Food Drive</a>
                                                                        </h2>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-meta"><ul><li>
                                    <i class="icon-calendar3"></i>
                                    Nov 10, 2026, 4:02 PM                                </li></ul></div>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-content">
                                    During November and early December, LeaderJacks students are sponsoring a food drive to support the Bottineau Food Pantry. The goal of the food drive is to collect nonperishable food items to help individuals and families in the local community who may need extra help this holiday season. Through this project, LeaderJacks hopes to make a positive impact while encouraging…                                </div>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                                    </div>
                </div>

            
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
                <div class="grid-inner">

                                                                    <div class="entry-image">    
                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/leaderjacks-assist-minot-rotary-club-fundraiser">
                                <img src="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/application/files/cache/thumbnails/rotary-club-news-09dd146993ed07fdb0107361ab0d76a4.png" alt="Leaderjacks assist the Minot Rotary Club in a Fundraiser">
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    
                                            <div class="entry-title">
                                                            <h2>
                                                                            <a href="https://www.dakotacollege.edu/about/news/leaderjacks-assist-minot-rotary-club-fundraiser"
                                           target="">Leaderjacks assist the Minot Rotary Club in a Fundraiser</a>
                                                                        </h2>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-meta"><ul><li>
                                    <i class="icon-calendar3"></i>
                                    Nov 2, 2026, 3:59 PM                                </li></ul></div>
                            
                                                            <div class="entry-content">
                                    Dakota College at Bottineau (DCB) hosts a leadership class each semester. The Leaderjacks learn to promote leadership through community service. They are introduced to methods of improving social, political, community, and family life. Class time introduces students to opportunities for leadership discussions such as self-efficacy and the importance of communication in…                                </div>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                                    </div>
                </div>

